# Your terminal is the theme: default `terminal` inherits your palette; opt-in themes and none.
Output docs/media/themes.gif
Set Width 1640
Set Height 960
Source docs/tapes/_setup.tape
Source docs/tapes/_replay.tape
Type "oomtop theme list"
Enter
Sleep 2.5s
Type "oomtop --theme ember"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Type "q"
Sleep 600ms
Type "oomtop --theme none"
Enter
Sleep 4s
Type "q"
Sleep 600ms
